{"suttaId":"tha-ap304","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9065,9077],"vripara":"5"},"segments":{"tha-ap304:0.3":"Sabbagandhiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap304:1.1":"“Gandhamālaṃ mayā dinnaṃ,","tha-ap304:1.2":"vipassissa mahesino;","tha-ap304:1.3":"Adāsiṃ ujubhūtassa,","tha-ap304:1.4":"koseyyavatthamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap304:2.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe,","tha-ap304:2.2":"yaṃ vatthamadadiṃ [gandhamadadiṃ (syā.)] pure;","tha-ap304:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","tha-ap304:2.4":"gandhadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap304:3.1":"“Ito pannarase kappe,","tha-ap304:3.2":"suceḷo nāma khattiyo;","tha-ap304:3.3":"Sattaratanasampanno,","tha-ap304:3.4":"cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap304:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap304:4.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap304:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sabbagandhiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap304:6.1":"Sabbagandhiyattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
